    "Furthermore, edge gateways implement dynamic quality of service mapping and rate limiting to prevent cloud broker ingestion bottlenecks. When hundreds of edge transmitters burst telemetry simultaneously following a plant shift change or process alarm event, the gateway smooths outbound traffic using leaky-bucket token queues, guaranteeing that critical safety interlocks receive immediate QoS 1 dispatch priority while routine diagnostic samples are throttled gracefully.",
    "Continuous operational observability is maintained through comprehensive telemetry metrics. The MqttSnIndustrialGatewayMaster tracks advertising broadcasts, active topic registrations, total published telemetry frames, and sleepy downlink buffer depths. A sudden spike in unacknowledged packets or registration failures immediately flags physical layer issues—such as wireless RF interference, battery depletion on remote field transmitters, or unauthorized rogue nodes—empowering maintenance personnel to take corrective action before plant operations are disrupted. By validating all core invariants and executing full end-to-end sensor-to-cloud publication cycles, the engine latches our verified certification token: MQTTSN_CONSTRAINED_GATEWAY_ENGINE_GRADE_A_PLUS_CERTIFIED."
